        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">in the css directory, changed all the CSS links to CSS properties only to macros</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42131",
            "title": "CSS properties only: Links to macros",
            "date_modified": "2025-11-27T12:42:40.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-11-26T14:20:40.000Z",
            "author": {
