        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Updated the documentation for the <code class=\"notranslate\">view()</code> CSS function to clarify its parameters and usage in animation timelines. Enhanced explanations of axis and inset parameters, and improved examples.</p>",
